        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1448] If the EVCC is using ServiceName = DC or DC_BPT in Table 204, after receiving the PowerDeliveryRes with \"ResponseCode = OK\" and if the previous PowerDeliveryReq message has ChargeProgress = \"Stop\", the EVCC shall send a DC_WeldingDetectionReq within V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Timeout according to Table 217.",
            "block_bbox": [
