        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1573] After receiving the DC_WeldingDetectionRes with \"ResponseCode = OK\", the EVCC shall send a DC_WeldingDetectionReq with EVProcessing set to \"Ongoing\" within V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Timeout according to Table 217 while the welding detection process is not finished.",
